Nor are you likely to, I think. IMHO, the biggest market for this particular
setup would be the educational-scientific one. I'm particularly thinking
of a large number of physics departments where physicists still prefer to 
write in fortran, and need the number crunching abilities of the alpha.

I know a few people in this crowd -- they don't seem like the types
to put together a petition for this. The fact is (no offense intended),
that they seldom seem to think of anything besides physics, so if you
want their attention you will have to go to them. 


> Compaq would very much like to encourage use of Alpha systems, and Compaq's
