I had a similar first experience...

I have assumed you have 36bit (true parity) simms. If you don't, you've 
got to resolve that problem first. 

You should probably start with more than 8Mb. As I recall, I could not 
get to the console prompt with only 8Mb, although this just might have 
been an order of discovery thing.

The final realization that got me over the edge was this...

After upgrading to 32Mb and a "supported" video card, there was still 
