of kernel floating point exception), but the feedback people say that's been
fixed now.  I was able to make some fairly nice spreadsheets and charts with
the spreadsheet function.

I haven't used the database or drawing parts yet.  But I'm pretty pleased with
it and will definitely be buying it when it comes out.

